{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "87d4296c-3c30-867d-a57f-00c23eb8316c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T09:18:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:13:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good morning, honey. I'm on the speaker here, I've got my hands full, so tell me if you can't hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds fine so far. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:14:16-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I own a little rental house, and I was out there yesterday morning to check on my tenant, and dear, the water. It comes right down the hill off the next street and straight across the yard. Straight into it. And it's the same thing every time we get a big melt or a rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And this was after the storm over the weekend? The snow that turned to rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:14:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one, Sunday into Monday. Snow all day Sunday and then it turned and just poured. By Monday morning the drain at the bottom of the hill was just bubbling and the whole road was a river."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "371 Admiral Kalbfus Road, up the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "371 Admiral Kalbfus. Okay, I'm writing that down. So water coming off the next street, into the yard, and the drain's not keeping up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And it's not just my yard, honey. The cars are slowing to a crawl going through it. I watched a fella in a little sedan creep along like he was crossing a pond. Somebody's going to stall out or slide into somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a safety thing too. Was the water over the road itself, or mostly along the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Over the road, curb to curb pretty much. Maybe halfway up a tire on the low part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now let me ask you, because I've been going back and forth on this. Is that a city drain or a state one? Somebody told me Admiral Kalbfus might be the state's. I don't know who to be bothering."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Some of the bigger roads around there are state, but I'd have to look at that stretch on the map. Either way, put it in with us and if it's theirs, we'll pass it along. You don't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a relief. Because I tell you, I've called about this before, and it feels like nobody ever comes. Same water, same spot, every time. I'm tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I don't see anything pulled up yet on my screen, so let me just start a fresh work order. Is there a name on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colleen Doyle. D-O-Y-L-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colleen Doyle. And a callback number in case somebody needs to meet you out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:16:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0184. Now, is the drain itself clogged, do you think? Leaves, ice, anything piled on top of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There was a crust of ice and slush over the top of it, and I did try to chip at it with a shovel. But you know, honey, I don't carry much with me except my pocketbook, and I had a pile of cash in there, so I wasn't about to go leaning over the road with it. I like paying for things in cash, always have, and I carry a good bit of it. So I stood there with the pocketbook clutched, poking at the ice like a goof."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd rather you not be out in the road anyway. Ice on a grate is really common this time of year, so that's probably part of it. I'll note ice cover and water running in from the upper street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And note the cars, please. The slowing down. I don't want somebody getting hurt and then it turns out I'd said nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Traffic slowing through standing water, safety concern. I'll mark it so the crew looks at it with that in mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And when do you think somebody'll get out there? Because there's more rain coming, they say, later this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews are still working through a backlog from the weekend, so I'd say a few days, give or take. I'll flag the forecast so it doesn't sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'd appreciate that. I just want it fixed, Kevin, not looked at. Looked at doesn't help my tenant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If it turns out to be a state drain, I'll make sure they get it and I'll let you know either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, then. Thank you, dear. You have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Colleen. Take care."
    }
  ],
